# Opening a book makes its screen, which asks; what reads its answer asks then.
tap open-1
clock settle
# Its own state changes its arguments; its refresh reaches it alone.
tap more-1
clock settle
tap open-2
clock settle
tap reload-2
clock settle
# Replace keeps the screen and asks with the new parameters.
tap swap-3
clock settle
# The gate closes: it keeps its answer; reopened, it asks again.
tap toggle
clock settle
tap more-1
clock settle
tap toggle
clock settle
# Back destroys the top screen and lets its request go.
tap back
clock settle
tap back
clock settle
# The instance outside every region asks with the root.
tap more-outside
clock settle
